{"story_id":30746,"updated_at":"2026-10-17T17:21:00","headline_en":"Darkness forces suspension of play at DP World India Championship","headline_hi":"डपी वर्ल्ड इंडिया चैंपियनशिप में अंधेरे के कारण खेल रोकना पड़ा","payload_en":{"story_id":30746,"headline":"Darkness forces suspension of play at DP World India Championship","counts":{"articles":2,"independent_sources":1,"outlets":1},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"express","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["Hindustan Times"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":30746,"parents":[],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-10-17T17:21:00","category":{"primary":["life"],"secondary":["sport-films"]},"places":[],"people":["Eugenio Chacarra","Yuvraj Sandhu","DP World India Championship","Om Prakash Chouhan","Tommy Fleetwood","Aaron Rai","Danny Willet","Gregorio De Leo"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"Play was suspended due to darkness at 5:44 PM today.","ids":[55817],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"On Saturday 17 October 2026, Eugenio Chacarra moved to the top of the leaderboard during the third round of the DP World India Championship.","ids":[55816],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Chacarra carded 4-under in the third round.","ids":[55818],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Chacarra took the lead after the end of Round 2.","ids":[55820],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"Players teed off for the third round 30 minutes after completing the second round.","ids":[55819],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"Chacarra sank seven birdies in Round 2 and made birdies on the 4th, 6th, and 7th holes.","ids":[55821,55825],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Chacarra made a 41-feet putt on the 7th hole and a 12-feet putt on the 6th hole.","ids":[55826,55827],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"Chacarra made a birdie on the first hole of the third round.","ids":[55824],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"Tommy Fleetwood made birdies on the 17th and 18th holes.","ids":[55828],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"Om Prakash Chouhan completed three rounds with a 1-under score.","ids":[55829],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"Yuvraj Sandhu had seven birdies in the last 10 holes in the second round.","ids":[55831],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Sandhu qualified for the next round of the DP World India Championship.","ids":[55846],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Sandhu finished the second round at 4-under, bringing the tournament total to one-under.","ids":[55850],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"The cut fell at even par with 77 players in a field of 144.","ids":[55835],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Fleetwood, Shane Lowry, Danny Willet, Justin Rose, Aaron Rai, and Patrick Reed made the cut.","ids":[55852],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Saptak Talwar, Karandeep Kochchar, and Shiv Kapur made it at par.","ids":[55853],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Chacarra said that it is nice to be at the top but a lot of golf remains, adding that he likes his current position and game, plays to win, and focuses on controlling what he can control.","ids":[55822,55823,55834],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"\"I’ve played here many times, so I know how to plan my way around the course and where to position the ball. That experience has helped me,\" Chouhan said.","ids":[55830],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"\"I just put my head down and went about the task at hand. I am still processing it,\" Sandhu said.","ids":[55845],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Chacarra holds a two-stroke lead at 14-under par and the tournament lead at 10-under par.","ids":[55832,55849],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"Fleetwood and Gregorio De Leo aggregated 9-under for the clubhouse lead.","ids":[55833],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"Six Indians out of 27 progressed to the money rounds.","ids":[55836],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Every one of the seven Major champions competing in the field advanced past the cut, a group that features Rory McIlroy at 6-under.","ids":[55851],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Chouhan is the best Indian on the leaderboard at 5-under, finishing at 4-under for the tournament.","ids":[55840,55859],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"The second round was completed on Day 3 due to a rain delay on the first day.","ids":[55854],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Play will restart at 06:35 AM on Sunday.","ids":[55842],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"Sandhu is preparing for Round 3 of the tournament.","ids":[55855],"class":"single","sources":[2]}]],"section_keys":["news","happened","happened","happened","happened","happened","happened","happened","happened","words","words","words","numbers","numbers","numbers","numbers","background","next","next"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/sports/others/dp-world-india-championship-eugenio-chacarra-on-the-charge-on-moving-day-as-finish-line-nears-101792248124206.html","outlet":"Hindustan Times","title":"DP World India Championship: Eugenio Chacarra on the charge on moving day as finish line nears","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/sports/others/dp-world-india-championship-yuvraj-sandhu-makes-cut-with-birdie-blitz-101792218917645.html","outlet":"Hindustan Times","title":"DP World India Championship: Yuvraj Sandhu makes cut with birdie blitz","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true}],"who":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Eugenio Chacarra","Om Prakash Chouhan","Yuvraj Sandhu",null,null,null,null,null,null,null]},"timeline":[],"undated":[],"established":[],"contested":[{"text":"Eugenio Chacarra surged to the top of the leaderboard during the third round of the DP World India Championship.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustanti