:1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/sports/others/dp-world-india-championship-eugenio-chacarra-on-the-charge-on-moving-day-as-finish-line-nears-101792248124206.html","stance":"attributes"}]},{"text":"The cut fell at even par with 77 players in a field of 144.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/sports/others/dp-world-india-championship-eugenio-chacarra-on-the-charge-on-moving-day-as-finish-line-nears-101792248124206.html","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Six Indians out of 27 progressed to the money rounds.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/sports/others/dp-world-india-championship-eugenio-chacarra-on-the-charge-on-moving-day-as-finish-line-nears-101792248124206.html","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Om Prakash Chouhan is the best Indian on the leaderboard at 5-under.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/sports/others/dp-world-india-championship-eugenio-chacarra-on-the-charge-on-moving-day-as-finish-line-nears-101792248124206.html","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Yuvraj Sandhu said he is still processing his performance.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/sports/others/dp-world-india-championship-yuvraj-sandhu-makes-cut-with-birdie-blitz-101792218917645.html","stance":"attributes"}]},{"text":"Yuvraj Sandhu qualified for the next round of the DP World India Championship.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/sports/others/dp-world-india-championship-yuvraj-sandhu-makes-cut-with-birdie-blitz-101792218917645.html","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Eugenio Chacarra leads the tournament at 10-under par.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/sports/others/dp-world-india-championship-yuvraj-sandhu-makes-cut-with-birdie-blitz-101792218917645.html","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Yuvraj Sandhu finished the second round at 4-under, bringing his tournament total to one-under.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/sports/others/dp-world-india-championship-yuvraj-sandhu-makes-cut-with-birdie-blitz-101792218917645.html","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"All seven Major winners in the field made the cut, including Rory McIlroy at 6-under.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/sports/others/dp-world-india-championship-yuvraj-sandhu-makes-cut-with-birdie-blitz-101792218917645.html","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Tommy Fleetwood, Shane Lowry, Danny Willet, Justin Rose, Aaron Rai, and Patrick Reed made the cut.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/sports/others/dp-world-india-championship-yuvraj-sandhu-makes-cut-with-birdie-blitz-101792218917645.html","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Saptak Talwar, Karandeep Kochchar, and Shiv Kapur made the cut at par.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/sports/others/dp-world-india-championship-yuvraj-sandhu-makes-cut-with-birdie-blitz-101792218917645.html","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Om Prakash Chouhan finished at 4-under for the tournament.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/sports/others/dp-world-india-championship-yuvraj-sandhu-makes-cut-with-birdie-blitz-101792218917645.html","stance":"asserts"}]}],"context":[{"text":"The second round was completed on Day 3 due to a rain delay on the first day.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/sports/others/dp-world-india-championship-yuvraj-sandhu-makes-cut-with-birdie-blitz-101792218917645.html","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Play will restart at 06:35 AM on Sunday.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/sports/others/dp-world-india-championship-eugenio-chacarra-on-the-charge-on-moving-day-as-finish-line-nears-101792248124206.html","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Yuvraj Sandhu is preparing for Round 3 of the tournament.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/sports/others/dp-world-india-championship-yuvraj-sandhu-makes-cut-with-birdie-blitz-101792218917645.html","stance":"asserts"}]}]},"payload_hi":{"story_id":30746,"headline":"डपी वर्ल्ड इंडिया चैंपियनशिप में अंधेरे के कारण खेल रोकना पड़ा","counts":{"articles":2,"independent_sources":1,"outlets":1},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"express","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["Hindustan Times"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":30746,"parents":[],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-10-17T17:21:00","category":{"primary":["life"],"secondary":["sport-films"]},"places":[],"people":["Eugenio Chacarra","Yuvraj Sandhu","DP World India Championship","Om Prakash Chouhan","Tommy Fleetwood","Aaron Rai","Danny Willet","Gregorio De Leo"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"आज शाम 5:44 बजे अंधेरे के कारण खेल रोक दिया गया।","ids":[55817],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"शनिवार 17 अक्टूबर 2026 को, डीपी वर्ल्ड इंडिया चैंपियनशिप के तीसरे दौर के दौरान यूजीनियो चाकारा लीडरबोर्ड में शीर्ष पर पहुंच गए।","ids":[55816],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"चाकारा ने तीसरे दौर में 4-अंडर का स्कोर किया।","ids":[55818],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"राउंड 2 के अंत के बाद चाकारा ने बढ़त बना ली।","ids":[55820],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"खिलाड़ियों ने दूसरा दौर पूरा करने के 30 मिनट बाद तीसरे दौर के लिए टी-ऑफ किया।","ids":[55819],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"चाकारा ने राउंड 2 में सात बर्डियाँ लगाईं और 4ठे, 6ठे और 7वें होल पर बर्डियाँ बनाईं।","ids":[55821,55825],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"चाकारा ने 7वें होल पर 41-फीट का पट और 6ठे होल पर 12-फीट का पट लगाया।","ids":[55826,55827],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"चाकारा ने तीसरे दौर के पहले होल पर बर्डी बनाई।","ids":[55824],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"टॉमी फ्लिटवुड ने 17वें और 18वें होल पर बर्डी लगाईं।","ids":[55828],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"ओम प्रकाश चौहान ने 1-अंडर स्कोर के साथ तीन दौर पूरे किए।","ids":[55829],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"युवराज संधू ने दूसरे दौर में अंतिम 10 होल में सात बर्डी लगाईं।","ids":[55831],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"संधू डीपी वर्ल्ड इंडिया चैंपियनशिप के अगले दौर के लिए क्वालीफाई कर गए।","ids":[55846],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"संधू ने दूसरा दौर 4-अंडर पर समाप्त किया, जिससे टूर्नामेंट का कुल स्कोर एक-अंडर हो गया।","ids":[55850],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"कट इवन पार पर लगा, जिसमें 144 के फील्ड में 77 खिलाड़ी शामिल थे।","ids":[55835],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"फ्लिटवुड, शेन लोरी, डैनी विलेट, रोज़, हारून राय और पैट्रिक रीड ने कट पार किया।","ids":[55852],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"सप्तक तलवार, करनदीप कोचर और शिव कपूर ने पार पर जगह बनाई।","ids":[55853],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"चाकारा ने कहा कि शीर्ष पर होना अच्छा है लेकिन अभी काफी गोल्फ बाकी है, उन्होंने आगे कहा कि उन्हें अपनी वर्तमान स्थिति और खेल पसंद है, वे जीतने के लिए खेलते हैं, और जो वे नियंत्रित कर सकते हैं उस पर ध्यान केंद्रित करते हैं।","ids":[55822,55823,55834],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"चौहान ने कहा, \"मैंने यहाँ कई बार खेला है, इसलिए मैं जानता हूँ कि कोर्स के आसपास अपनी योजना कैसे बनानी है और गेंद को कहाँ रखना है। उस अनुभव ने मेरी मदद की है।\"","ids":[55830],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"संधू ने कहा, \"मैंने बस अपना सिर नीचे रखा और अपने काम में जुट गया। मैं अभी भी इसे समझ रहा हूँ।\"","ids":[55845],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"चाकारा 14-अंडर पार पर दो-स्ट्रोक की बढ़त बनाए हुए हैं और 10-अंडर पार पर टूर्नामेंट में आगे हैं।","ids":[55832,55849],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"फ्लिटवुड और ग्रेगोरियो डी लियो ने क्लबहाउस लीड के लिए कुल 9-अंडर का स्कोर किया।","ids":[55833],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"27 में से छह भारतीय मनी राउंड में आगे बढ़े।","ids":[55836],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"मैदान में प्रतिस्पर्धा कर रहे सात मेजर चैंपियन में से प्रत्येक कट से आगे बढ़ गए, एक ऐसा समूह जिसमें 6-अंडर पर रोरी मैक्लरॉय शामिल हैं।","ids":[55851],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"चौहान 5-अंडर पर लीडरबोर्ड पर सर्वश्रेष्ठ भारतीय हैं, जिन्होंने टूर्नामेंट के लिए 4-अंडर पर समापन किया।","ids":[55840,55859],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"पहले दिन बारिश के कारण हुई देरी के कारण दूसरा दौर दिन 3 को पूरा हुआ।","ids":[55854],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"खेल रविवार को सुबह 06:35 बजे फिर से शुरू होगा।","ids":[55842],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"संधू टूर्नामेंट के राउंड 3 की तैयारी कर रहे हैं।","ids":[55855],"class":"single","sources":[2]}]],"section_keys":["news","happened","happened","happened","happened","happened","happened","happened","happened","words","words","words","numbers","numbers","numbers","numbers","background","next","next"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/sports/others/dp-world-india-championship-eugenio-chacarra-on-the-charge-on-moving-day-as-finish-line-nears-101792248124206.html","outlet":"Hindustan Times","title":"DP World India Championship: Eugenio Chacarra on the charge on moving day as finish line nears","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/sports/others/dp-world-india-championship-yuvraj-sandhu-makes-cut-with-birdie-blitz-101792218917645.html","outlet":"Hindustan Tim