text":"युवराज संधू ने डीपी वर्ल्ड इंडिया चैंपियनशिप के अगले दौर के लिए क्वालीफाई किया।","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/sports/others/dp-world-india-championship-yuvraj-sandhu-makes-cut-with-birdie-blitz-101792218917645.html","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"यूजीनियो चाकारा 10-अंडर पार पर टूर्नामेंट में आगे हैं।","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/sports/others/dp-world-india-championship-yuvraj-sandhu-makes-cut-with-birdie-blitz-101792218917645.html","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"युवराज संधू ने दूसरे दौर को 4-अंडर पर समाप्त किया, जिससे उनका टूर्नामेंट का कुल स्कोर एक-अंडर हो गया।","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/sports/others/dp-world-india-championship-yuvraj-sandhu-makes-cut-with-birdie-blitz-101792218917645.html","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"फील्ड में मौजूद सभी सात मेजर विजेताओं ने कट पार किया, जिसमें 6-अंडर पर रोरी मैक्लरॉय भी शामिल हैं।","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/sports/others/dp-world-india-championship-yuvraj-sandhu-makes-cut-with-birdie-blitz-101792218917645.html","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"टॉमी फ्लिटवुड, शेन लोरी, डैनी विलेट, जस्टिन रोज़, हारून राय और पैट्रिक रीड ने कट पार किया।","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/sports/others/dp-world-india-championship-yuvraj-sandhu-makes-cut-with-birdie-blitz-101792218917645.html","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"सप्तक तलवार, करनदीप कोचर और शिव कपूर ने पार पर कट पार किया।","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/sports/others/dp-world-india-championship-yuvraj-sandhu-makes-cut-with-birdie-blitz-101792218917645.html","stance":"asserts"}]},{"t